<title>AUSTRALIA: Hawker Richardson turnover features on ASX.</title>
<headline>Hawker Richardson turnover features on ASX.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Takeover target Hawker Richardson Ltd featured in Australian Stock Exchange turnover lists on Wednesday with 7.35 million shares traded.</p>
<p>The bulk of the trade was in one line of 5.67 million shares bought by ANZ Securities at A$1.86 per share, equal to the takeover price offered by Austrim Ltd.</p>
<p>ANZ Securities is the broker acting for Austrim.</p>
<p>Austrim is bidding A$1.86 per share for Hawker with the offer due to close on August 7.  </p>
<p>Austrim said before the opening of trading on Wednesday that it held 66.32 percent of Hawker Richardson, an auto parts manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
